WEBVTT

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:02.164
because it leads us to believe
that it's been solved by that hero,

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.045
and we have no role.

00:02:05.323 --> 00:02:06.863
We don't need heroes.

00:02:06.887 --> 00:02:09.339
We need radical interdependence,

00:02:09.363 --> 00:02:12.225
which is just another way
of saying we need each other.

00:02:12.792 --> 00:02:16.024
Even though other people
can be really difficult, sometimes.

00:02:18.334 --> 00:02:21.929
I spent decades trying to work out
how to be a good leader.

00:02:21.953 --> 00:02:24.794
I've lived in seven countries
and five continents.

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:26.783
And in recent years,

00:02:26.807 --> 00:02:29.736
I've spent a lot of time
with the B Corp community,

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.823
originally as a corporate participant